/en/israel-bans-arab-parties-from-election-what-you-need-to-know/a-79461211--de136cc4aa6b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-bans-arab-parties-from-election-what-you-need-to-know/a-79461211?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Israel's push to ban Arab parties from standing in the upcoming election has been called "another nail in the coffin of democracy." Is there a legal basis for doing this, and what could it mean for Arab voters?</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>US ban on Canadian alcohol, dairy products and motorcycles takes effect as trade dispute escalates</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a367980ea2301b09f969a534968263b9cd32d3925cc312391fa8b5f219cb70c2</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T11:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-ban-on-canadian-alcohol-dairy-products-and-motorcycles-takes-effect-as-trade-dispute-escalates/a-79471701--cf1521441333.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-ban-on-canadian-alcohol-dairy-products-and-motorcycles-takes-effect-as-trade-dispute-escalates/a-79471701?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump's ban on nearly $1 billion worth of Canadian goods has come into force, further escalating a trade dispute between the longtime allies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iraq: US troops withdraw from their Iraqi US-led Operation Inherent Resolve mission against ISIS after 12 years as Baghdad delays militia disarmament</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:315d41b6c2abe23b660985782de6044d75104cc4f7c282f5e9feee5f75ec3450</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T11:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iraq-us-troops-withdraw-from-their-iraqi-us-led-operation-inherent-resolve-mission-against-isis-afte/a-79462926--5b2f211b74d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iraq-us-troops-withdraw-from-their-iraqi-us-led-operation-inherent-resolve-mission-against-isis-after-12-years-as-baghdad-delays-militia-disarmament/a-79462926?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the US completes its military withdrawal from Iraq, Baghdad declares a new era of sovereignty. But as US troops leave, questions remain over militias, foreign forces and the country's future security.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Global trade weathers Iran, Ukraine and Trump's tariffs</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c30a909990b4d300c71c510e97ef9c0e4c4cc999cba1db09acfc718feddfc5a</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T10:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/global-trade-weathers-iran-ukraine-and-trump-s-tariffs/a-79352643--538fe77d9a72.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/global-trade-weathers-iran-ukraine-and-trump-s-tariffs/a-79352643?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Over the past six years, COVID, two wars and Donald Trump's tariffs have shaken world trade. With globalization already stalling, is this a temporary shock or the start of a great reversal?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Malaysia repatriates Myanmar migrants despite UN warnings</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eddc26db2cb4e1d1dae78b31d1b912c2f8ff8a0ad3192dbc23e9a9c9bc1ceeb8</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T10:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/malaysia-repatriates-myanmar-migrants-despite-un-warnings/a-79470814--e0fb5ad7aea0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/malaysia-repatriates-myanmar-migrants-despite-un-warnings/a-79470814?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Malaysia has started repatriating about 1,500 Myanmar nationals, defying warnings from the UN and rights groups. Malaysia, facing an uptick in anti-migrant sentiment, says the program is strictly voluntary.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>AI: Concern as Germany plans to double data center capacity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a27fe60991adc6a26de0880ea337bd02594ac5df2173dc467fcfa167fd6724c8</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ai-concern-as-germany-plans-to-double-data-center-capacity/a-79407981--ddf2b388dfde.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ai-concern-as-germany-plans-to-double-data-center-capacity/a-79407981?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany is rewriting the rules to attract data center investment from AI companies. But local communities are becoming increasingly skeptical.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Spain grows fruit and vegetables for Europe — but it's running out of water</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:343f1d29d6c33bb927830f0eaf81ad361c57776588515b886c614c3a61a478b6</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:55:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T09:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-grows-fruit-and-vegetables-for-europe-but-it-s-running-out-of-water/a-79399905--7611f918b844.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-grows-fruit-and-vegetables-for-europe-but-it-s-running-out-of-water/a-79399905?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Spain's southern coast produces up to 25% of Europe's fruit and vegetables. But amid intensive farming, climate change and illegal wells, the water it takes to grow them is drying up.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Argentina's Milei threatens UK with international legal action over Falkland Islands oil project</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3c867e5002df5c461703e63e5039bc39da0c120ab9efdc7774889961059c276</i