er.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel's Netanyahu holds secret meeting with UAE president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3332c1ace4b2609d504413ee7fbdb8da971a09ec3e773c7dd8bcc6da50b9066b</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:54:07Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T01:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israel-s-netanyahu-holds-secret-meeting-with-uae-president/a-79467271--ad566d17ce40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-s-netanyahu-holds-secret-meeting-with-uae-president/a-79467271?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After confirming a rare meeting, Netanyahu's office has denied suggestions that the Israeli prime minister requested that Abu Dhabi deny reports that it had warned Israel about an impending Hamas attack in 2023.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
